From bb0abb3a806e9f3d7179b584090a8a7d0834dfea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 12:11:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(build): guard blank applicationId from CI config
 injection; add missing LocalSourceRepository

- app/build.gradle.kts: applicationId now falls back to a legacy default
  when rapunzel.app.package resolves to a blank string (e.g. CI runs
  without the packaging secret set overwrite the committed default with
  an empty value), which was leaving ${applicationId} unresolved in the
  manifest merge.
- Add LocalSourceRepository, the NovelSource wrapper for locally
  imported files backed by LibraryDao. PluginRegistry has depended on
  this class since it was introduced but it was never created, which
  broke KSP/Hilt processing (PluginRegistry constructor).
- Remove stray unapplied *.patch files left over from prior debugging
  sessions.
---
